    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Hack n' Slash | Roguelite | Rhytmn | Tower Defense</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the last line of defense for an entire species</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with nanomachines, the last defender of humanity can be <strong>upgraded</strong> to shape it into <strong>powerful weapons and tools</strong>. It\u2019s up to you to choose which\u2014and, more importantly, when.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold, upgrade, and hold again</strong> to ensure the survival of mankind\u2014all set against the backdrop of fast-paced soundtracks and nerve-wracking gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478760/extras/dad3e474483c887488fe62925506a1a4.poster.avif?t=1755124188\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478760/extras/dad3e474483c887488fe62925506a1a4.webm?t=1755124188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478760/extras/dad3e474483c887488fe62925506a1a4.mp4?t=1755124188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rhythmic Arms Race</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you evolve, so too does the enemy, creating increasingly complex bots to breach your defenses. <strong>Learn their patterns and master the beat to prevail</strong>, no matter how many attempts it takes, humanity's survival is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478760/extras/b8f5053cede13a25aec6dce823ff4fcd.poster.avif?t=1755124188\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478760/extras/b8f5053cede13a25aec6dce823ff4fcd.webm?t=1755124188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478760/extras/b8f5053cede13a25aec6dce823ff4fcd.mp4?t=1755124188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight in a arcade atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the pixel art to the animations and the sound design HOLD FOR HUMANS is soaked in the 8 bit realm to deliver you the arcade experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Hack n' Slash | Roguelite | Rhytmn | Tower Defense</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the last line of defense for an entire species</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with nanomachines, the last defender of humanity can be <strong>upgraded</strong> to shape it into <strong>powerful weapons and tools</strong>. It\u2019s up to you to choose which\u2014and, more importantly, when.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold, upgrade, and hold again</strong> to ensure the survival of mankind\u2014all set against the backdrop of fast-paced soundtracks and nerve-wracking gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478760/extras/dad3e474483c887488fe62925506a1a4.poster.avif?t=1755124188\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478760/extras/dad3e474483c887488fe62925506a1a4.webm?t=1755124188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478760/extras/dad3e474483c887488fe62925506a1a4.mp4?t=1755124188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rhythmic Arms Race</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you evolve, so too does the enemy, creating increasingly complex bots to breach your defenses. <strong>Learn their patterns and master the beat to prevail</strong>, no matter how many attempts it takes, humanity's survival is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478760/extras/b8f5053cede13a25aec6dce823ff4fcd.poster.avif?t=1755124188\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478760/extras/b8f5053cede13a25aec6dce823ff4fcd.webm?t=1755124188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3478760/extras/b8f5053cede13a25aec6dce823ff4fcd.mp4?t=1755124188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight in a arcade atmosphere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the pixel art to the animations and the sound design HOLD FOR HUMANS is soaked in the 8 bit realm to deliver you the arcade experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Hold the line so that humanity may live another day. Defend the evacuation lanes from the relentless spawns of a rogue AI in this rhythm/roguelite-infused hack n\u2019 slash/tower defense game. Upgrade the last friendly robot on Earth, armed with a unwavering program and purpose: HOLD.FOR.HUMANS.",
